  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> High-Precision Optics </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The ZOLLER »smileCheck« and »smartCheck« series of instruments feature high-quality, industry-grade optics: For example, cutting radii, angles, lengths, diameters, and other parameters on the outer contour of tools can be measured automatically via transmitted light with μm-accurate measurement accuracy.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#c3642\">ZOLLER Multi-sensor technology</a><br/><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/smartCheck/Info-Pool/ZOLLER_smileCheck_spindel_DE.pdf\">Spindle Technology »smileCheck«</a><br/><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/fileadmin/02_Products/smartCheck/Info-Pool/ZOLLER_smartCheck_spindel_DE.pdf\">Spindle Technology »smartCheck«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/9/csm_optik_12_246fdcccd7.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1646",
   "bg": "black",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "overlay",
   "img": {
    "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/4/1/csm_multisensorik_f1c73c37a6.webp",
    "alt": "",
    "w": 996,
    "h": 848
   },
   "title": "Multi-sensor technology",
   "text": "<p>Saved measurement sequences are executed fully automatically at the push of a button (CNC version). In incident light mode, manual measurements can be performed in the chip space, on the circumference, and on the end face. Cutting edge detection supports user-independent measurements. Innovative software packages automate your incident light measurements. The high-definition cutting edge patterns are also ideal for your documentation.</p>",
   "ftype": "zoller_overlay",
   "id": "c3642",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {}
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> The Fact Check for Tools </h2>",
   "body": "<p>A »smartCheck« from ZOLLER is simple to use and delivers outstanding performance across the board. Even the basic version is equipped with a wide range of features and can be flexibly expanded at any time with software packages.</p> <p>The ZOLLER Inspection &amp; Measuring Solution proves what many claim: quality. </p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/solutions/inspection-measuring\">Learn more about Inspection &amp; Measuring</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/2/csm_qualitaet_smartcheck_ef29c2af13.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1454,
     "h": 1454
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c1644",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "default",
    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »smartCheck« 450/600/800« </h3> <h2> In-Process Tool Inspection </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The »smartCheck« 450/600/800« series from ZOLLER offers you comprehensive tool inspection: State-of-the-art technologies combined with outstanding ease of use ensure efficient production procedures. The wide range of measuring ranges and variable equipment make a »smartCheck« an all-around solution for your diverse tool portfolio. Rely on precise measurement data to guarantee the reliable quality of your products.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/products/inspection-measuring/universal-measuring-machine/smartcheck/models/smartcheck-450\">Learn more about »smartCheck«</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/3/csm_smartCheck_slider_de_ce05054a87.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1200,
     "h": 1068
    }
   ],
   "videos": [],
   "pos": "right",
   "cols": 1,
   "valign": "center",
   "ftype": "textmedia",
   "id": "c2319",
   "bg": "",
   "space": {
    "before": "small",
    "after": "none"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> »smileCheck« </h3> <h2> Precision Tool Quality </h2>",
   "body": "<p>In addition to its user-friendly operating concept, ZOLLER »smileCheck« stands out above all for its compact design, ensuring safety in your production and increased speed. Tool parameters, geometric data, and chamfer lead contours can be entered both radially and axially. »smileCheck« also enables you to prepare your grinding wheel packs quickly and precisely.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/ca/products/inspection-measuring/universal-measuring-machine/smartcheck/models/smilecheck\">Learn more about »smileCheck«</a></p>",
